","dish/peremech"],["Pilaf","dish/pilaf"],["Qazı","dish/qaz"]]}]},"dish/tocino-de-cielo":{"t":"dish","r":"dish/tocino-de-cielo","n":"Tocino de cielo","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish found in 3 cuisines","dot":"#cf5f87","intro":[["Tocino de cielo is a Spanish dessert made primarily of egg yolks, sugar, and water. Unlike flan, it does not contain milk or any other dairy product."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-tocino-de-cielo"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tocino_de_cielo"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["Andalusian cuisine","cuisine/andalusian-cuisine"],["Asturian cuisine","cuisine/asturian-cuisine"],["Portuguese cuisine","cuisine/portuguese-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Ingredients","count":3,"links":[["Egg yolk","ingredient/egg-yolk"],["Egg yolks","ingredient/egg-yolks"],["Sugar","ingredient/sugar"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Food From Portugal","ref":"site/foodfromportugal-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"foodfromportugal.com","note":"Portuguese-run recipe site and video channel of traditional Portuguese dishes.","url":"https://www.foodfromportugal.com/","suggested":true}]},{"h":"More from Andalusian cuisine","links":[["Ajoblanco","dish/ajoblanco"],["Chicharrón","dish/chicharron"],["Gachas","dish/gachas"],["Gazpachuelo","dish/gazpachuelo"],["Migas","dish/migas"],["Porra antequerana","dish/porra-antequerana"],["Puchero","dish/puchero"]]}]},"dish/tout-a-fait":{"t":"dish","r":"dish/tout-a-fait","n":"Tout à Fait","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish found in 2 cuisines","dot":"#cf5f87","intro":[["Restaurant Rotisserie Tout à Fait is a restaurant in Maastricht, Netherlands. It is a fine dining restaurant that was awarded one Michelin star in 2002 and retained that rating until present."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-tout-a-fait"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tout_%C3%A0_Fait"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where 